Requirement-to-Concept Trace:
| Requirement                         | Concept        | State/Behaviour                     | Decision        |
|-------------------------------------|----------------|--------------------------------------|-----------------|
| Create patient records              | Patient        | Stores patient details               | Accepted        |
| Search patient records              | Patient        | Provides lookup identifiers          | Accepted        |
| Manage practitioner availability    | Practitioner   | Availability schedule                | Accepted        |
| Book appointments                   | Appointment    | Links patient + practitioner         | Accepted        |
| Prevent double-booking              | Appointment    | Conflict detection                   | Accepted        |
| Update appointment status           | Appointment    | Status changes                       | Accepted        |
| View practitioner schedule          | Practitioner   | Retrieves appointments                | Accepted        |
| Generate reports                    | Appointment    | Historical data                       | Accepted        |

CRC Cards:
Patient:
Responsibilities:
- Store patient details
- Provide patient identification
- Link to appointment history
Collaborators:
- Appointment

Practitioner:
Responsibilities:
- Store practitioner details
- Maintain availability
- View schedule
Collaborators:
- Appointment

Appointment:
Responsibilities:
- Store appointment date, time, status
- Link patient and practitioner
- Update status (booked, cancelled, completed)
Collaborators:
- Patient
- Practitioner

Clinic:
Responsibilities:
- Aggregate system-level objects
- Provide high-level coordination 
Collaborators:
- Patient
- Practitioner
- Appointment

